      SuperscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "\[Prime]"]], "InlineFormula",
      FormatType->StandardForm,ExpressionUUID->
      "e5c5bd56-2e56-4c56-805f-206bf5d5c93e"],
     " and zero for ",
     Cell[BoxData[
