Cell["\<\
Because the constructor assumes undefined symbolic variables are strictly \
real, passing a single symbol as a complex shape parameter will strip out any \
intended imaginary components. You must explicitly include the imaginary unit \
if you want symbolic complex parameters:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.995994812853779*^9},
 CellID->1915948351,ExpressionUUID->"203334e9-72c7-45f5-b12f-66699d8f95ca"],

